# Without strict mode, the scan of the boundary at byte 283 (the second buffer's start, inside record 17's quoted value
# with escaped quotes) tries a start inside record 19 whose trial row carries a quote through the next buffer to the end
# of the file. That row of 349 bytes is over max_line_size, so the start is refused as it is within one buffer, and
# every record is read once.

